approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/1/agent: `LocationTriageAgent` is defined outside these files; only its place in the workflow was imported
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/4/agent: `LocationCaptureAgent` is defined outside these files; only its place in the workflow was imported
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/7/agent: `LocationAwareAgent` is defined outside these files; only its place in the workflow was imported
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/7/input/externalLoop: the agent talks with the user while `Upper(System.LastMessage.Text) <> "EXIT"` holds; drawn as one turn
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/4: work goes from `LocationCaptureAgent` to `LocationAwareAgent` only when Not(Local.LocationResponse.is_location_defined = false Or Local.LocationResponse.is_location_confirmed = false) (Power Fx); the condition is kept under extensions `com.microsoft.agent-framework` and the handoff is drawn without it
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/4: work goes from `LocationCaptureAgent` to `LocationTriageAgent` only when Local.LocationResponse.is_location_defined = false Or Local.LocationResponse.is_location_confirmed = false (Power Fx); the condition is kept under extensions `com.microsoft.agent-framework` and the handoff is drawn without it
approximated InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions/2: the workflow waits for the user's answer here; not drawn, so the agents before and after it are linked directly
unsupported InputArguments.yaml#/trigger/actions: actions that keep variables, send messages or manage conversations (CreateConversation ×1, SetTextVariable ×1, SetVariable ×2) are not drawn; the workflow is kept under extensions `com.microsoft.agent-framework`
